/// env override. Precedence (last wins):
///   1. Default: `info`.
///   2. `-v` / `-q` counts shift relative to info.
///   3. `--log-level=...` overrides absolutely.
///   4. Pre-existing `LATTICE_LOG` env var trumps flags so
