    // TUI's stderr is the editor terminal — every event
    // would blit a stray line over ratatui's paint. Defaults
    // OFF for TUI, ON for GPUI. `--stderr-logs` forces ON
    // (e.g. `lattice --tui --stderr-logs 2>tracing.log`).
